{"id": "06f57e60-720a-4d3a-bf3e-32c0d0bfe192", "slug": "premium-app-ui", "title": "Premium App UI", "description": "Premium App Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Premium App UI\"\ndescription: \"Premium App Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#E7BF70\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#256BFF\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#14234B\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"ui-serif\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"30px\"\n  control: \"22px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Premium App UI\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 55; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: background, animated, threejs, effect.\n## Overview\nPremium App Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\n9:41 Hello, Alex! Find your next scenic drive All Coastal Mountain Urban Pacific Coast Hwy California, USA 3 days 650 mi Trending Routes High Elevation Stelvio Pass Italy Fast Chargers Route 66 USA Home Routes Saved Pro…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Hello, Alex!; Pacific Coast Hwy; Trending Routes; Stelvio Pass; Route 66; About this route.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #E7BF70, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #256BFF, background #FFFFFF, surface #14234B, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse -apple-system for display moments and ui-serif for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Luma Grand Suite - Premium iOS Hotel UI</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --gold: #e7bf70;\n      --gold-light: #f8dda2;\n      --ink: #050605;\n      --glass: rgba(18, 18, 16, .72);\n      --line: rgba(255,255,255,.13);\n      --phone-shadow:\n        0 2.8px 2.2px rgba(0,0,0,0.034),\n        0 6.7px 5.3px rgba(0,0,0,0.048),\n        0 12.5px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.06),\n        0 22.3px 17.9px rgba(0,0,0,0.072),\n        0 41.8px 33.4px rgba(0,0,0,0.086),\n        0 100px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: #fff;\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"SF Pro Display\", \"SF Pro Text\", Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n      text-rendering: geometricPrecision;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      overflow: auto;\n    }\n\n    .wrap {\n      width: max-content;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      padding: 40px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 40px;\n      background: white;\n    }\n\n    .iphone {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 393px;\n      height: 852px;\n      flex: 0 0 393px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border-radius: 56px;\n      border: 12px solid #070809;\n      background: var(--ink);\n      box-shadow: var(--phone-shadow);\n    }\n\n    .iphone::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: -1px;\n      z-index: 100;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      border-radius: 44px;\n      box-shadow:\n        inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.18),\n        inset 0 0 30px rgba(255,255,255,.05);\n    }\n\n    .screen {\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: 0;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border-radius: 43px;\n      color: #fff;\n      background: #050605;\n    }\n\n    .status {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      z-index: 92;\n      height: 58px;\n      padding: 0 24px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      color: white;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 650;\n      letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    }\n\n    .status .icons {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .island {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 12px;\n      left: 50%;\n      z-index: 96;\n      width: 124px;\n      height: 36px;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: #000;\n    }\n\n    .island::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 12px;\n      right: 19px;\n      width: 10px;\n      height: 10px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #256bff 0 13%, #14234b 42%, #020308 72%);\n      opacity: .9;\n    }\n\n    .scroll {\n      height: 100%;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      scrollbar-width: none;\n    }\n\n    .scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n\n    .serif {\n      font-family: ui-serif, Georgia, Cambria, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      letter-spacing: -0.055em;\n    }\n\n    .glass {\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(28,28,25,.80), rgba(8,9,8,.72));\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(160%);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(160%);\n      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.10);\n    }\n\n    .soft-glass {\n      background: rgba(18,18,16,.50);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(155%);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(155%);\n      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.10);\n    }\n\n    .icon-btn {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 44px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      color: white;\n      background: rgba(8,8,7,.48);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(140%);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(140%);\n    }\n\n    .chip {\n      height: 40px;\n      padding: 0 17px;\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      color: rgba(255,255,255,.88);\n      background: rgba(255,255,255,.09);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 560;\n      letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    }\n\n    .chip.active {\n      color: #15120c;\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f9e3ae 0%, var(--gold) 100%);\n      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.46);\n      font-weight: 720;\n    }\n\n    .dot-active {\n      width: 24px;\n      height: 6px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--gold);\n    }\n\n    .dot {\n      width: 6px;\n      height: 6px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: rgba(255,255,255,.36);\n    }\n\n    .home-indicator {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 50%;\n      bottom: 8px;\n      z-index: 96;\n      width: 132px;\n      height: 5px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 1320px) {\n      body { place-items: start; }\n      .wrap { justify-content: flex-start; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"wrap\" aria-label=\"Three iPhone 16 Pro hotel booking screens\">\n    <!-- LEFT IPHONE -->\n    <section class=\"iphone\" aria-label=\"Hotel discovery screen\">\n      <div class=\"screen\">\n        <div class=\"island\"></div>\n        <div class=\"status\">\n          <span>9:41</span>\n          <div class=\"icons\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cellular-outline\" width=\"17\"></iconify-icon>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wi-fi-outline\" width=\"17\"></iconify-icon>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:battery-charge-outline\" width=\"21\"></iconify-icon>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"scroll px-6 pt-[86px] pb-[116px] bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_74%_0%,rgba(231,191,112,.10),transparent_28%),linear-gradient(180deg,#080907_0%,#050605_100%)]\">\n          <header class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n            <div>\n              <h1 class=\"serif text-[30px] leading-none font-[520] text-white\">Good evening</h1>\n              <p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-5 text-white/66\">Boutique hotels, curated for tonight</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 pt-2\">\n              <button class=\"text-white\" aria-label=\"Search\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\" width=\"25\"></iconify-icon>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"relative text-white\" aria-label=\"Filter\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:tuning-2-linear\" width=\"25\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"absolute -right-1 -top-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--gold)]\"></span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </header>\n\n          <nav class=\"-mx-6 mt-7 flex gap-2.5 overflow-x-auto px-6 pb-1\" aria-label=\"Hotel filters\">\n            <span class=\"chip active\">All</span>\n            <span class=\"chip\">Suites</span>\n            <span class=\"chip\">Resorts</span>\n            <span class=\"chip\">Spa</span>\n            <span class=\"chip\">Wellness</span>\n          </nav>\n\n          <article class=\"relative mt-5 h-[324px] overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border border-white/[.08] shadow-[0_24px_54px_rgba(0,0,0,.34)]\">\n            <img\n              class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"\n              src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop\"\n              alt=\"Nobu Garden hotel\"\n            />\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.08)_0%,rgba(0,0,0,.05)_32%,rgba(0,0,0,.84)_100%)]\"></div>\n\n            <button class=\"icon-btn absolute right-4 top-4\" aria-label=\"Save hotel\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:heart-linear\" width=\"22\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-5 right-5\">\n              <h2 class=\"serif text-[26px] leading-none font-[520] text-white\">Nobu Garden</h2>\n              <p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] text-white/76\">Phuket, Thailand</p>\n\n              <div class=\"mt-4 flex gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/34 px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] text-white backdrop-blur-xl\">\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clock-circle-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-[var(--gold)]\"></iconify-icon>\n                  4 nights\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/34 px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] text-white backdrop-blur-xl\">\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:ticket-sale-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-[var(--gold)]\"></iconify-icon>\n                  From $620\n                </span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center gap-1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <span class=\"dot-active\"></span>\n            <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n            <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n            <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n            <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <h3 class=\"serif text-[23px] leading-none font-[520]\">Editor’s selection</h3>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[13px] font-[700] text-[var(--gold)]\">See all</a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"-mx-6 mt-4 flex gap-3 overflow-x-auto px-6 pb-5\">\n            <article class=\"relative h-[196px] w-[176px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] border border-white/[.08]\">\n              <img class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599619351208-3e6c839d6828?q=80&w=700&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Aman Loft hotel\">\n              <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/88 via-black/16 to-transparent\"></div>\n              <span class=\"absolute left-3 top-3 rounded-lg bg-black/50 px-2 py-1 text-[11px] backdrop-blur-lg\">-15%</span>\n              <button class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-black/42 backdrop-blur-lg\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:heart-linear\" width=\"19\"></iconify-icon>\n              </button>\n              <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-[15px] font-[700] tracking-[-.03em]\">Aman Loft</h4>\n                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-white/66\">Ubud, Bali</p>\n                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-white/72\">From $540</p>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"relative h-[196px] w-[176px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] border border-white/[.08]\">\n              <img class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618220179428-22790b461013?q=80&w=700&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Casa Valoura hotel\">\n              <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/88 via-black/16 to-transparent\"></div>\n              <span class=\"absolute left-3 top-3 rounded-lg bg-black/50 px-2 py-1 text-[11px] backdrop-blur-lg\">-10%</span>\n              <button class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-black/42 backdrop-blur-lg\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:heart-linear\" width=\"19\"></iconify-icon>\n              </button>\n              <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-[15px] font-[700] tracking-[-.03em]\">Casa Valoura</h4>\n                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-white/66\">Lisbon, Portugal</p>\n                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-white/72\">From $480</p>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <nav class=\"glass absolute bottom-5 left-6 right-6 z-50 flex h-[72px] items-center justify-around rounded-[30px] px-3\" aria-label=\"Bottom navigation\">\n          <a class=\"flex h-[54px] w-[62px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-[22px] text-[10px] font-[680] text-[var(--gold)]\" href=\"#\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:home-smile-bold\" width=\"22\"></iconify-icon>\n            Home\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"flex h-[54px] w-[62px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-[22px] text-[10px] text-white/62\" href=\"#\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:compass-linear\" width=\"22\"></iconify-icon>\n            Explore\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"flex h-[54px] w-[62px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-[22px] text-[10px] text-white/62\" href=\"#\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:suitcase-lines-linear\" width=\"22\"></iconify-icon>\n            Trips\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"flex h-[54px] w-[62px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-[22px] text-[10px] text-white/62\" href=\"#\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:heart-linear\" width=\"22\"></iconify-icon>\n            Saved\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"flex h-[54px] w-[62px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-[22px] text-[10px] text-white/62\" href=\"#\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-rounded-linear\" width=\"22\"></iconify-icon>\n            Profile\n          </a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <div class=\"home-indicator\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- CENTER IPHONE -->\n    <section class=\"iphone\" aria-label=\"Premium suite detail booking screen\">\n      <div class=\"screen\">\n        <div class=\"island\"></div>\n        <div class=\"status\">\n          <span>9:41</span>\n          <div class=\"icons\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cellular-outline\" width=\"17\"></iconify-icon>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wi-fi-outline\" width=\"17\"></iconify-icon>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:battery-charge-outline\" width=\"21\"></iconify-icon>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <img class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687920-4e2a09cf159d?q=80&w=1400&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Luxury suite terrace\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(6,6,5,.18)_0%,rgba(6,6,5,.08)_38%,rgba(6,6,5,.58)_67%,rgba(6,6,5,.96)_100%)]\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute left-6 right-6 top-[66px] z-50 flex items-center justify-between\">\n          <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Back\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-left-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n\n          <div class=\"soft-glass flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-[680] text-white\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:verified-check-bold\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-[var(--gold)]\"></iconify-icon>\n            Luma Select\n          </div>\n\n          <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Save suite\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:heart-linear\" width=\"22\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"soft-glass absolute left-[110px] top-[184px] z-30 rounded-full px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-[650] text-white\">\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-bold\" width=\"15\" class=\"mr-1 text-[var(--gold)]\"></iconify-icon>\n          Private terrace\n          <span class=\"absolute left-7 top-full h-3 w-3 -translate-y-1.5 rotate-45 bg-[rgba(18,18,16,.70)]\"></span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"soft-glass absolute right-[28px] top-[328px] z-30 rounded-full px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-[650] text-white\">\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:eye-bold\" width=\"15\" class=\"mr-1 text-[var(--gold)]\"></iconify-icon>\n          Premium city view\n          <span class=\"absolute left-10 top-full h-3 w-3 -translate-y-1.5 rotate-45 bg-[rgba(18,18,16,.70)]\"></span>\n        </div>\n\n        <section class=\"glass absolute bottom-[28px] left-6 right-6 z-40 rounded-[30px] px-5 pb-5 pt-5 shadow-[0_28px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,.42)]\">\n          <p class=\"text-[11px] font-[760] uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--gold)]\">Signature suite</p>\n\n          <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start justify-between gap-4\">\n            <div>\n              <h1 class=\"serif text-[31px] leading-[.94] font-[520] text-white\">Luma Grand Suite</h1>\n              <p class=\"mt-4 text-[15px] text-white/74\">Barcelona, Spain</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"rounded-[18px] border border-white/[.10